Package: glmworkbenchR
Title: GLM Workbench - R Shiny Port of the Actuarial Pricing Workbench
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Markus", "Koenig", email = "markuskoenig73@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny application mirroring the Python GLM Workbench (Streamlit)
    screens: dataset registry with parquet loaders, kind-aware portfolio
    validation, feature engineering, and namespaced page modules sharing one
    reactive state. Feasibility study for an end-user-computing (EUC)
    deployment of a Shiny app packaged as an R package.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
